<title>UK: Granada, Carlton extend gains after TV licence deal.</title>
<headline>Granada, Carlton extend gains after TV licence deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Granada Plc and Carlton Communications Plc continued to rise on Tuesday after their joint venture British Digital Broadcasting (BDB) was awarded a digital terrestrial broadcasting licence.</p>
<p>By 0940 Carlton was up 22p to 538-1/2p while Granada gained 9p to 844p.</p>
</text>
